No JCI binaries, controller applications, credentials, or manuals are redistributed.

The optional native compiler/simulator integrates linsong/sedona, commit
406b11f3816fb00db6482640f9cf3397b874b515, copyright 2006-2013 Tridium, Inc.
Upstream: https://github.com/linsong/sedona
Its Academic Free License 3.0 and trademark notice are retained in
third_party/Sedona-LICENSE.md. The SDK source is downloaded separately;
scripts/setup_sedona.py reproduces modifications to the compiler's reference
layout/null optimization and the SVM's null-pointer/UDP ABI handling. The native
simulation build binds sockets to loopback. This experimental port is not a
Sedona-certified platform. Generated application bundles contain an upstream
license copy and source/build provenance for their included SCode runtime.
